WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
A group chat pings.

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:05.800
Short lines, a few
abbreviations, a laughing emoji.

3
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.450
Beside it, a typed page headed Transcript.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.090
Names in capitals.

5
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.730
Full, careful sentences.

6
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.100
Both are full of people's words.

7
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.440
Both scroll by at the same speed.

8
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:21.100
So why do they look nothing alike?

9
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.310
In this mission, you'll pick up five
questions to ask about any text's context.

10
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:30.480
You'll ask whether spoken and written
are really two separate boxes.

11
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:34.840
And you'll compare a chat between two
friends with a witness answering questions

12
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:35.980
in court.

13
00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:39.490
Your mission: explain why
they look nothing alike.
